        "text": {
            "description_html": "<P><b>Paddle Lever with Radius Rose Fusion-AF-B2</B></P>\r\n\r\n<P><B>Specifications</B> for Paddle Lever with Radius Rose Fusion-AF-B2:<UL>\r\n<LI>Solid Brass Forging and Casting</LI>\r\n<LI>True Bronze Product (Sandcast and Lost Wax) with over 90% Copper Content</LI>\r\n<LI>Standard Latch Rotation is 40 Degrees</LI>\r\n<LI>Cycle Tested to ANSI Standards</LI>\r\n<LI>All Dummy Interior (Single or Double) are surface mounted using Fusion \"Quick Install\" with safety ramp</LI>\r\n<li>Pre-Installed Rose saves time, money and perfect indexing on the door.</LI></UL></P>\r\n\r\n<P><B>Warranty</B> for Paddle Lever with Radius Rose Fusion-AF-B2:<UL>\r\n<LI>Lifetime Limited Warranty on workmanship, materials, and operation</LI>\r\n<LI> Natural Bronze and Finishes over Bronze carry a one year warranty</LI></UL></P>\r\n\r\n<p><B>Choosing a Function:</B><ul>\r\n<li>Single Dummy: For use as a pull or to match trim.</li>\r\n<li>Double Dummy: Stationary both sides of door</li>\r\n<li>Passage (Hall or Closet): For doors that don't need locking.</li>\r\n<li>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom): For doors that could need locking.</li></ul></p>",
